    mc "呃……不好意思，为什么你带我来这？还有15分钟就要上课了，现在不回去的话老师肯定会批评我们的。"

# game/ep4.rpy:14
translate chinese ep4_c8c2c166:

    # mc "And it's just the second day of class."
    mc "而且今天才是开学第二天。"

# game/ep4.rpy:15
translate chinese ep4_20340416:

    # g "......"
    g "......"

# game/ep4.rpy:16
translate chinese ep4_26e5426f:

    # mc "Smoking is not allowed on school premises, you know?"
    mc "学校里是不能吸烟的，你知道吗？"

# game/ep4.rpy:19
translate chinese ep4_63695132:

    # g "...Second day of class, huh?"
    g "……开学第二天，是吧？"

# game/ep4.rpy:20
translate chinese ep4_3b21f354:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep4.rpy:21
translate chinese ep4_546c9280:

    # g "It's just the second day of class and the second day since you transferred here, yet you already confessed to someone you barely even know."
    g "才开学第二天，也是你转学过来第二天，你就已经跟一个你几乎不认识的女生表白了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:22
translate chinese ep4_2103a486:

    # g "I don't know what it is that you saw in Aine, but you really just plunged your life into hell. I hope you have as much guts to fight back as you did when you confessed to her."
    g "我不知道你到底看上了艾妮哪一点，但你已经一只脚踏进地狱了。我希望你在反抗她的时候也有跟向她表白的时候一样的勇气。"

# game/ep4.rpy:23
translate chinese ep4_d4214580:

    # g "Because that's the first and the last time I'll defend you. I can't stop her doing anything she wants with you after this."
    g "因为刚刚是我第一次，也是最后一次给你说话了。之后她想对你做什么我都管不了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:24
translate chinese ep4_3237cf0d:

    # mc "What do you mean by that exactly?"
    mc "你这是什么意思？"

# game/ep4.rpy:27
translate chinese ep4_e0d60514:

    # g "Aine... is a bully at this school."
    g "艾妮……是学校里的恶霸。"

# game/ep4.rpy:28
translate chinese ep4_085722e2:

    # mc "What?!"
    mc "什么？！"

# game/ep4.rpy:29
translate chinese ep4_15a89111:

    # g "I pretty much expected that reaction, but you heard me."
    g "我就知道你会是这种反应。"

# game/ep4.rpy:30
translate chinese ep4_f99951b8:

    # g "...Nobody can touch her or even fight back because of her family name. I didn't think you'd know that since you just transferred here."
    g "……在知道她的家庭背景之后，没人敢反抗她，更别说去让她吃苦头了。你刚刚转来，所以不知道。"

# game/ep4.rpy:31
translate chinese ep4_bd9eead4:

    # g "She turns down and humiliates every guy who confesses to her. And you got the worst-case scenario. You've got amazingly bad luck — you caught her in a bad mood."
    g "她会拒绝并羞辱所有向她表白的男生。而你正好碰上了最坏的情况。你运气非常不好，选在了她心情很差的时候去表白。"

# game/ep4.rpy:32
translate chinese ep4_eaab2f5a:

    # g "So, all I can say is... good luck."
    g "所以，我只能说……祝你好运了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:35
translate chinese ep4_07c73c00:

    # mc "Oh, man... What did I step in?!"
    mc "噢，天啊……我都干了什么？"

# game/ep4.rpy:36
translate chinese ep4_85719985:

    # g "Hmn? Love at first sight, I assume?"
    g "哼，一见钟情是吧？"

# game/ep4.rpy:37
translate chinese ep4_da087d23:

    # g "Well, she's pretty, but you should at least know the girl first before actually confessing."
    g "确实，她很漂亮，但你表白之前至少要了解一下人家啊。"

# game/ep4.rpy:38
translate chinese ep4_5d3dd49e:

    # mc "Awww~! Now I'm fucked!"
    mc "啊啊啊啊~！我完蛋了！"

# game/ep4.rpy:41
translate chinese ep4_5dd77bab:

    # g "I... want her to stop it. I want her to stop doing this, but she won't listen to me at all."
    g "我……想让她住手的。我想让她以后别这样了，但她根本不听我的。"

# game/ep4.rpy:44
translate chinese ep4_fda44056:

    # mc "Huh? You guys are friends then? Are you a bully too?!"
    mc "啊？你们是朋友吗？难道你也霸凌吗？！"

# game/ep4.rpy:45
translate chinese ep4_62ac6c67:

    # g "Haha! Who knows?"
    g "哈哈！谁知道呢？"

# game/ep4.rpy:46
translate chinese ep4_6434dfd2:

    # mc "Ugh..."
    mc "啊……"

# game/ep4.rpy:49
translate chinese ep4_05d89a4a:

    # g "But... I just want to have a good time. I don't care about anything else and just want to live the life I want."
    g "我呢……只是想过得开心点。我不在乎其他的，只想过我想要的生活。"

# game/ep4.rpy:50
translate chinese ep4_b005fe91:

    # g "Freedom, you know? Haha!"
    g "自由自在的，你懂吧？哈哈！"

# game/ep4.rpy:51
translate chinese ep4_b7b35a07:

    # mc "Freedom? Are your parents strict or something?"
    mc "自由？你的父母管得很严吗？"

# game/ep4.rpy:52
translate chinese ep4_d1e7d147:

    # g "Hmm... not that much. *giggles*"
    g "嗯……也不是很严。 *笑*"

# game/ep4.rpy:55
translate chinese ep4_8fff3cb4:

    # g "By the way, what's your name again? [mc!t], right?"
    g "对了，你叫什么来着？[mc!t]，是吧？"

# game/ep4.rpy:56
translate chinese ep4_d897e449:

    # mc "Uhh... yeah?"
    mc "呃……对啊？"

# game/ep4.rpy:57
translate chinese ep4_cfa7a7d4:

    # g "I'm Gwen. Nice to meet you, [mc!t]."
    g "我叫格温。很高兴见到你，[mc!t]。"

# game/ep4.rpy:58
translate chinese ep4_eda3c3d3:

    # mc "N-nice to meet you too. But, we sit next to each other, so I already know your name."
    mc "我——我也很高兴认识你。不过，你的座位就在我旁边。我已经知道你叫什么了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:59
translate chinese ep4_3e436fb4:

    # g "Oh, we do? I hadn't noticed you."
    g "啊，是吗？我都没注意到你。"

# game/ep4.rpy:60
translate chinese ep4_ab47b1f5:

    # mc "How could you notice when all you do is look at your phone or listen to music with your headphones on even while the class is still going?"
    mc "你上课的时候不是戴耳机听音乐就是玩手机，怎么可能注意到我？"

# game/ep4.rpy:63
translate chinese ep4_658ea8f1:

    # g "Ahh... Like I care about classes anyway."
    g "啊……反正我也不在乎什么上课。"

# game/ep4.rpy:64
translate chinese ep4_3a90108f:

    # mc "B-but why?"
    mc "可是为什么啊？"

# game/ep4.rpy:65
translate chinese ep4_e5af4b05:

    # g "Just don't mind me."
    g "不用管我。"

# game/ep4.rpy:68
translate chinese ep4_14d3f295:

    # g "Say... Do you like angels?"
    g "我问你……你喜欢天使吗？"

# game/ep4.rpy:69
translate chinese ep4_562379c9:

    # mc "Huh? Angels? Where did that question come from?"
    mc "啊？天使？怎么突然说这个？"

# game/ep4.rpy:70
translate chinese ep4_cc071825:

    # g "Ehh... Just give me an answer!"
    g "啧……回答我就是了！"

# game/ep4.rpy:71
translate chinese ep4_261a4661:

    # mc "Uhm... Maybe? I never really thought of that before. Why?"
    mc "嗯……应该喜欢吧？我之前从来没想过这个问题。怎么了？"

# game/ep4.rpy:74
translate chinese ep4_dcf21038:

    # g "I... always dreamed of becoming an angel since I was a kid. Those fluffy wings and stuff, you know? Haha!"
    g "我……小时候总想变成天使。背后长带羽毛的翅膀那种的，你知道吧？哈哈！"

# game/ep4.rpy:77
translate chinese ep4_54798c5e:

    # g "I want to know how it feels to fly and touch the sky... Am I that weird for wishing such fantasy?"
    g "我想知道自由翱翔、触摸天空是什么感觉……我这种幻想是不是很奇怪？"

# game/ep4.rpy:78
translate chinese ep4_f275c6ad:

    # mc "Well... sort of. Why are you telling me all this anyway? You're getting kinda creepy."
    mc "嗯……是有点。你跟我说这些干嘛？我都觉得你有点吓人了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:81
translate chinese ep4_bacd74b5:

    # g "Haha! Never mind. Now go buy me some wine at the store nearby."
    g "哈哈！别管了。现在你去附近的店里给我买酒去吧。"

# game/ep4.rpy:82
translate chinese ep4_407ee573:

    # mc "Wait, what?! You're drinking, too?! But more importantly, there's only seven minutes left until first period! I'm going to be late!"
    mc "不是，什么？！你还喝酒？！而且还有七分钟就要上课了啊！我会迟到的！"

# game/ep4.rpy:85
translate chinese ep4_b88d45f8:

    # g "Ahh, just run! I'll wait for you at the school entrance, so at least you won't be late alone. Haha!"
    g "哎，跑起来！我在校门口等你，所以至少你不会一个人迟到。哈哈！"

# game/ep4.rpy:86
translate chinese ep4_b4879b93:

