translate chinese ep4_9f89f77f:

    # yt "Ugh... Why am I doing this? If the guard happens to see us, we'll be busted for sure!"
    yt "唉……我在干嘛？要是门卫看见我们，那我俩肯定就完蛋了！"

# game/ep4.rpy:103
translate chinese ep4_9b532d24:

    # g "Oh, there you are! That was quick! Did you actually run back and forth?"
    g "哦，你回来了！还挺快的！你真是一路跑来又跑去的吗？"

# game/ep4.rpy:104
translate chinese ep4_63bad25e:

    # mc "Well, I don't want to be late!"
    mc "肯定啊，我不想迟到！"

# game/ep4.rpy:107
translate chinese ep4_05d5bee2:

    # mc "Here's your wine, I'm going back to cla-"
    mc "这是你的酒，我现在得赶紧回——"

