translate chinese ep4_b51435ac:

    # g "Johnny, this is [mc!t] — my classmate. [mc!t], this is Johnny, my bodyguard."
    g "强尼，这是[mc!t]——我的同学。[mc!t]，这是强尼，我的保镖。"

# game/ep4.rpy:136
translate chinese ep4_21fea603:

    # mc "I beg your pardon? What do you mean, your bodyguard?!"
    mc "你说什么？保镖是什么意思？！"

# game/ep4.rpy:137
translate chinese ep4_908bbfb9:

    # g "Literally what I just said! Haha!"
    g "就是字面意思啊！哈哈！"

# game/ep4.rpy:138
translate chinese ep4_71692a93:

    # jo "I worked as a school guard before, you see. But the monthly pay is not enough since I have a pretty big family with thirteen kids to feed."
    jo "我之前是这里的门卫。但我有三个孩子要养，光一份工资是不够用的。"

# game/ep4.rpy:139
translate chinese ep4_78c07115:

    # mc "Whoa~! That's..."
    mc "哇~！那可……"

# game/ep4.rpy:140
translate chinese ep4_9bf5e6bf:

    # jo "And that's where the young lady comes in."
    jo "这时候我认识了小姐。"

# game/ep4.rpy:141
translate chinese ep4_15822f6f:

    # jo "She offered me to work for Mister Glenn — the young lady's father — as his bodyguard, but... this is how it turned out in the end."
    jo "她问我愿不愿意给格伦先生——小姐的父亲——当保镖，但……最后变成了现在这种情况。"

# game/ep4.rpy:142
translate chinese ep4_3baed27d:

    # jo "I still work here as a guard, while being the young lady's bodyguard at the same time."
    jo "我没有辞掉门卫的工作，但同时也兼任小姐的保镖。"

# game/ep4.rpy:143
translate chinese ep4_b9bd605d:

    # jo "They pay me more than enough to sustain my entire family's needs. So I'm extremely grateful to her."
    jo "他们给我的薪酬十分丰厚。所以我非常感谢小姐。"

# game/ep4.rpy:144
translate chinese ep4_59a7d539:

    # mc "I still don't get it... How did you two get to know each other in the first place?"
    mc "我还是不懂……你们俩怎么会认识的？"

# game/ep4.rpy:147
translate chinese ep4_561605c7:

    # g "Do you still have to ask that? Of course, he caught me cutting classes a lot! Hahaha!"
    g "这你还用得着问吗？他天天都抓到我逃课呗！哈哈哈！"

# game/ep4.rpy:148
translate chinese ep4_0ecf2d07:

    # jo "*lightly chuckles*..."
    jo "*轻声笑*..."

# game/ep4.rpy:149
translate chinese ep4_6a4d0d2f:

    # mc "Well... that's understandable, I guess? But why do you seem so proud of it?"
    mc "好吧……倒也有道理。但你怎么看起来这么骄傲？"

# game/ep4.rpy:152
translate chinese ep4_88fb1f92:

    # jo "Anyway, you two should go now before you're late for your first class. You still have two minutes till the period officially starts."
    jo "总之，你们现在赶紧回去吧，不然就迟到了。距离正式上课还有两分钟时间。"

# game/ep4.rpy:155
translate chinese ep4_86968fe6:

    # g "Yeah! We should run!"
    g "对啊！快跑！"

# game/ep4.rpy:156
translate chinese ep4_ac321c39:

    # mc "Oh, not again..."
    mc "唉，怎么又要跑……"

# game/ep4.rpy:157
translate chinese ep4_d380ab1a:

    # g "Thanks, as always, Johnny. See you later!"
    g "一直以来谢啦，强尼。再见！"

# game/ep4.rpy:158
translate chinese ep4_16712212:

    # jo "Always my pleasure, young lady. Please take care."
    jo "乐意为您效劳，小姐。请小心。"

# game/ep4.rpy:161
translate chinese ep4_cbb4b73e:

    # jo "{i}That kid... he's the transfer student here, right? Why do I have this feeling that I've met him somewhere before... That's strange.{/i}"
    jo "{i}那个男生……他是刚转来的吧？为什么我感觉我之前见过他……奇怪。{/i}"

# game/ep4.rpy:162
translate chinese ep4_ddcef818:

    # jo "{i}He looks like someone I know, too. What the hell is this feeling?{/i}"
    jo "{i}他看着还很像一个我认识的人。为什么我会有这种感觉？{/i}"

# game/ep4.rpy:168
translate chinese ep4_3cc981d5:

    # "A week later..."
    "一周以后……"

# game/ep4.rpy:176
translate chinese ep4_404a32cd:

    # yt "Ugghh... Why did she have to let me buy those things now that the cafeteria ran out of food?!"
    yt "唉……食堂的东西都卖光了，她还让我去买干嘛？！"

# game/ep4.rpy:177
translate chinese ep4_8bef98e1:

    # yt "She's intentionally making me fail, god damnit!"
    yt "她明知道我什么都买不到，肯定是故意的，可恶！"

# game/ep4.rpy:178
translate chinese ep4_2b7e9a7f:

    # yt "Now those two bitches kept on calling me Piggy all day long! What the heck is wrong with them?"
    yt "现在那两个贱女人每天都喊我猪头！她们脑子有病吗？"

# game/ep4.rpy:181
translate chinese ep4_e8863011:

    # yt "*sighs*..."
    yt "*叹气*..."

# game/ep4.rpy:184
translate chinese ep4_1a4d0aa0:

    # g "{i}*singing* Got over it ages ago... Where we were from the same river. Thinking about how we lost our minds... I don't care what's in the past...{/i}"
