# game/ep4.rpy:185
translate chinese ep4_cd8ed8d3:

    # g "{i}*singing* They don't care about old trouble... Many wars wherever you go... Somebody please! Can we stop all the fights? I'll do it because it's my-{/i}"
    g "{i}*唱*他们对积怨视而不见……无论你所在何处都是战火连绵……我祈求着有谁！能阻止这所有的争斗……我将接下这份任务，只因现在是我的——{/i}"

# game/ep4.rpy:188
