translate chinese klarapause_eff1e84c:

    # gl "Well, of course I'm not proud of it. I did change when I met her mother. She guided me down the path of righteousness, no pun intended."
    gl "不过呢，当然这不是什么值得骄傲的事。我在遇见她妈妈之后变了很多。她带我走上了正义的道路，我说的正义可不是比喻。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1766
translate chinese klarapause_97801d6a:

    # mc "Pun? I'm sorry to be slow on the uptake, but what do you mean exactly?"
    mc "比喻？抱歉，我没太听懂。你是什么意思？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1767
translate chinese klarapause_f0d3b0f7:

    # gl "Ahh yes. You don't know her mother yet. That's where we get to the real reason you're here."
    gl "啊，对了。你还不认识她妈妈。其实这才是你来这的真正原因。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1769
translate chinese klarapause_524090b4:

    # gl "What I'm about to tell you, just relax, and keep an open mind. You hear me, [mc!t]?"
    gl "我接下来要告诉你一些事，你放轻松听就好，不要太在意。知道了吗，[mc!t]？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1770
translate chinese klarapause_3bac97a7:

    # mc "Uhm... I'm a little nervous now that you've said that, but alright. I'll do my best."
    mc "嗯……我反而有点紧张了，但我会照做的。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1771
translate chinese klarapause_3aca0fc9:

    # gl "You see, her mother is like the 'all hail Valhalla' kind of person."
    gl "其实，她妈妈是有点像那种“英灵殿万岁！”一样的人。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1772
translate chinese klarapause_55a6b0bd:

    # mc "Uhm... I beg your pardon? Now I'm confused."
    mc "呃……能请您再说一遍吗？我完全没有听懂。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1773
translate chinese klarapause_94cc9c3e:

    # gl "Ahahaha! I'm sorry, I just love making fun of stuff."
    gl "啊哈哈哈哈！对不起，我就是喜欢拿各种事开玩笑。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1774
translate chinese klarapause_c3a80aab:

    # mc "Even your wife?"
    mc "连你老婆也不放过吗？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1775
translate chinese klarapause_2289dfe6:

    # gl "Well... yes? Haha!"
    gl "嗯……对啊？哈哈！"

# game/ep4.rpy:1776
translate chinese klarapause_48bd412c:

    # yt "Now I'm really a thousand percent sure where Gwen got her personality."
    yt "我现在真是百分之一千确定格温遗传的是谁的性格了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1778
translate chinese klarapause_e44c4d6c:

    # gl "But enough jokes."
    gl "但玩笑也开够了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1779
translate chinese klarapause_cbc35d76:

    # gl "My wife and I... or should I say 'ex-wife' now."
    gl "我和我的妻子……或者应该说是前妻了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1780
translate chinese klarapause_007f5f24:

    # yt "Huh?"
    yt "嗯？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1781
translate chinese klarapause_cd133c30:

    # gl "We knew what happened to you and Gwen during high school."
    gl "我们已经知道高中的时候你跟格温之间发生过什么了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1782
translate chinese klarapause_e232d0b3:

    # mc "!!!"
    mc "！！！"

# game/ep4.rpy:1783
translate chinese klarapause_7ca84cba:

    # gl "Now don't be shocked — take a deep breath. I'm going to explain everything."
    gl "不要太惊讶——深呼吸。我会解释清楚的。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1784
translate chinese klarapause_ad467756:

    # gl "You see, Gwen never lies to us, she tells us everything, and doesn't keep secrets from us."
    gl "你看，格温从不会对我们说谎，她什么事都会告诉我们，从不会瞒着我们。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1785
translate chinese klarapause_e2998b0e:

    # gl "I am, for once, not against it. You might think I'm irresponsible as a parent, but it's not that. Even though she's a bit thick-headed, Gwen always knows what she's doing."
    gl "我从来不会反对格温的决定。你可能觉得作为父亲，我这样的行为并不负责，但不是这样的。尽管她有时候显得有些笨，但格温绝不会做傻事。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1786
translate chinese klarapause_47796608:

    # gl "That may not seem true, given what happened with her in the past."
    gl "虽然从她的过去来看，我说的话好像并不对。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1787
translate chinese klarapause_8670f483:

    # gl "She repeated a grade in middle school twice, and that explains why she was two years older than the rest of you and your class, but I knew she had it in her to succeed."
    gl "尽管她在初中时留级两年，但我知道她将来会成功的。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1788
translate chinese klarapause_65c6ac45:

    # gl "With that in mind, I gave her as much freedom to spread her wings as she wanted. But deep down, I knew it wasn't the best way of parenting."
    gl "于是我就尽可能给她自由，让她尽情享受。但在我心里，我也知道这并不是教育孩子最好的方式。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1789
translate chinese klarapause_ff1f25a2:

    # gl "However, I knew how she felt, as I had been in the same situation where I wanted to do anything I decided in my life."
    gl "我知道她当时内心的感受。我在那个年纪，也是一样的，想要不被其他人干涉，尽情做自己想做的事情。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1790
translate chinese klarapause_b37821a0:

    # gl "I believed she would change one day, and she did."
    gl "我相信她总有一天会改变的，后来她也的确变了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1791
translate chinese klarapause_88755472:

    # yt "I can see why even Johnny let her do what she wanted at school."
    yt "我现在知道为什么强尼在学校里从来不管她了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1792
translate chinese klarapause_a159115d:

    # gl "In contrast to me, Emilda doesn't think like that. No, not at all."
    gl "但与我相反，埃米尔达完全不那么想。她跟我的想法完全不一样。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1793
translate chinese klarapause_a1b69d8f:

    # gl "She's a very strict and religious woman."
    gl "她是个又严格又笃信宗教的女人。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1794
translate chinese klarapause_edb3e707:

    # mc "Did you guys fight when you learned about what happened to me and Gwen?"
    mc "那你们在知道我和格温的事之后吵架了吗？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1797
translate chinese klarapause_cf7cf3f4:

    # gl "That is right. That's when everything fell apart."
    gl "是的。事情就是从那时候开始变坏的。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1798
translate chinese klarapause_1aebe697:

    # gl "'You need to be this, you need to do that.' She was choking her daughter with her beliefs and I didn't want her to do that. All I wanted was for her to trust her own child."
    gl "“你得这样，格温”，“你得那样，格温”，她总是给我们的女儿灌输她自己的想法，我不喜欢那样。我只想让她相信她自己的女儿。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1807
translate chinese klarapause_67d3e09e:

    # gl "Still, I couldn't really blame her, because that's what she truly believes in."
    gl "但是，我也不能怪她，毕竟那是她发自内心的信仰。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1808
translate chinese klarapause_1c9106b7:

    # gl "The fight got worse day by day up to the point where we couldn't understand each other any longer, and that culminated in our divorce."
    gl "我们每天都吵得不可开交，到了最后，再也无法互相理解了。于是我们离婚了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1809
translate chinese klarapause_0290e5d9:

    # yt "Has Gwen carried that on her shoulders all this time?"
    yt "格温一直以来都自己背负着这么多吗？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1810
translate chinese klarapause_f395e81b:

    # yt "Damn it! I'm such an idiot! I should've taken responsibility for my own actions!"
    yt "操！我真是个傻逼！我早就应该对自己的行为负责的！"

# game/ep4.rpy:1819
translate chinese klarapause_f11b483d:

    # gl "Now I bet you're blaming yourself over what happened to our family."
    gl "我敢说你现在正在为我们家的事怪罪自己。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1820
translate chinese klarapause_1bf3d4e0:

    # gl "And you shouldn't, [mc!t]. As a man, I know what you're thinking. Don't be bothered about it, because everything is in the past already."
    gl "不用那样的，[mc!t]。作为一个男人，我知道你在想什么。不要太在意了，毕竟一切都是过去了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1821
translate chinese klarapause_7faa02ce:

    # gl "You moved on from what Hera's daughter did to you. So, I believe you can move on from this too."
    gl "你已经放下过去赫拉的女儿对你做的事了，肯定也能放下这件事的。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1822
translate chinese klarapause_3fdda710:

    # mc "You knew what was happening back then too?"
    mc "你知道我那时候的事情？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1823
translate chinese klarapause_b9e8759e:

    # gl "Of course. Gwen and I wanted to offer you some protection, but it's Hera we're talking about here."
    gl "当然。我和格温本来想帮你，但毕竟这件事的背后是赫拉。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1824
translate chinese klarapause_cafc8683:

    # gl "No matter who you are, there's no way you can stop her do anything that she wants to achieve. Although, we don't have any idea what her goal really was."
    gl "不管你是什么人，都不可能挡她的路的。尽管我们也不知道她在路的尽头的目标到底是什么。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1825
translate chinese klarapause_24c43dd8:

    # mc "Thank you for trying to protect me, Glenn. You're as good a man as what Gwen told me."
    mc "谢谢你愿意保护我，格伦。格温说你是个好人，我很同意。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1826
translate chinese klarapause_57f1d55b:

    # mc "But don't worry. I've arranged to learn everything about Hera. I'm going to hear it from her own mouth."
    mc "不用担心。我已经做了安排，要从赫拉那里知道一切。我要听她亲口告诉我真相。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1827
translate chinese klarapause_509b0ad0:

    # gl "Ahh... A brave man, I see. I like you, [mc!t]. I can sense determination from you. You're a man of culture."
    gl "啊……看来你还是个勇士。我很中意你，[mc!t]。我看得出来你有非常坚定的决心。你是个有修养的人。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1828
translate chinese klarapause_0deaa6dc:

    # gl "I can see why my daughter likes you now. Though, I wonder why you didn't fight back against Hera's daughter. You liked the gal, I assume?"
    gl "我现在知道为什么我女儿喜欢你了。但，我不知道为什么你当时没有反抗赫拉的女儿。我猜是你喜欢那个女孩？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1829
translate chinese klarapause_9916f23e:

    # mc "I was interested in her, yes. And me being a soft-hearted man on top of that. I... can never hurt a woman, Glenn. I just don't have it in me."
    mc "我当时确实喜欢她，没错。而且再加上我还是个软心肠。我……永远不可能伤害女生的，格伦。我不是那种人。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1830
translate chinese klarapause_d4294d34:

    # gl "That's what I wanted to hear. Haha!"
    gl "这正是我想听的。哈哈！"

# game/ep4.rpy:1831
translate chinese klarapause_ef2169b3:

    # gl "I feel more confident leaving my daughter to you now that you said that."
    gl "有了你这句话，我把女儿交给你就更放心了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1832
translate chinese klarapause_4d319b45:

    # gl "Being soft-hearted may backfire at you at some point, but remember that it's not a bad thing. Kindness always outweighs greed, that's what I believe."
    gl "心肠太软有时候也会让你吃苦头，但一定记住，温柔绝不是坏事。善良总是比欲望更重要，这是我的信念。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1833
translate chinese klarapause_db86e4b4:

    # gl "Forgiving and forgetting is a sign of maturity, both mental and emotional."
    gl "原谅和遗忘是成熟的标志，不管是在心理上还是在情感上。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1834
translate chinese klarapause_770e61ab:

    # gl "Holding to petty concepts and feelings like revenge only makes you a bitter and pathetic person."
    gl "死抓着复仇这种概念不放只会让你变成刻薄又可悲的人。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1835
translate chinese klarapause_8ec8d8b7:

    # mc "...How did you-"
    mc "……你是怎么——"

# game/ep4.rpy:1836
translate chinese klarapause_3b640a36:

    # gl "I'm a man, [mc!t]. If I were in that situation, I would also seek revenge. I know how you feel."
    gl "我也是男人，[mc!t]。假如我遇到在你身上发生的事，我也会想报仇雪恨的。我知道你的感受。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1837
translate chinese klarapause_1e994c09:

    # gl "But! The best revenge is to show the people who mistreated you that, even though they made your life hell, you came out of it on top."
    gl "但是，对那些虐待你的人来说，最好的复仇就是让他们看到，即便他们让你的生活一团糟，你也最终站了起来，继续前进。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1838
translate chinese klarapause_c9e3a838:

    # gl "Getting revenge on someone only shows that you're no better than they are, don't you think?"
    gl "回去报复他们只能说明你不比他们好到哪去，你说呢？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1839
translate chinese klarapause_73fddf48:

    # mc "Yeah, I agree."
    mc "是啊，我同意。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1843
translate chinese klarapause_f1d248e4:

    # g "Excuse me, boys! Done talking already?"
    g "打扰了，男士们！聊完了吗？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1844
translate chinese klarapause_85884d30:

    # g "Here's your coffee, by the way."
    g "这是你们的咖啡。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1845
translate chinese klarapause_a64e8bc0_1:

    # mc "Thanks."
    mc "谢谢。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1849
translate chinese klarapause_3862c287:

    # yt "It is perfect timing that she came now."
    yt "她来得正好。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1852
translate chinese klarapause_c9cdeebb:

    # yt "I think I need to decide what to do now. This will be indeed my best opportunity to make it a formal request."
    yt "我现在需要做决定了。现在就是我正式请求的最佳时机。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1853
translate chinese klarapause_a14c5bd4:

    # yt "Even though Glenn told me to not worry about it, it doesn't really matter. I... I like Gwen. I really like her."
    yt "尽管格伦让我不要在意，但我不能无动于衷。我……我喜欢格温。我真的很喜欢她。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1854
translate chinese klarapause_b5ee0670:

    # yt "I was unaware of it, but what happened with us last night was an eye-opener for me."
    yt "我之前没有发觉，但昨晚的事情让我想通了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1855
translate chinese klarapause_c5911791:

    # yt "It unearthed my feelings for her that were locked in the past."
    yt "昨晚的事让我找回了我对她那些被锁在过去的感情。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1856
translate chinese klarapause_54384b7c:

    # yt "I will not let her carry this alone. Further, after what Glenn told me, I absolutely want to connect Gwen and her mother's relationship again."
    yt "我不能让她独自背负一切。而且，在知道她家里的事情以后，我一定要修复她和她妈妈的关系。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1857
translate chinese klarapause_9b5e6cc3:

    # yt "I want to see her smile without any trace of worry."
    yt "我想看见她没有担忧、纯洁无瑕的微笑。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1858
translate chinese klarapause_0097ce09:

    # yt "What should I do?"
    yt "我要怎么办？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1862
translate chinese klarapause_a3690c11:

    # yt "Yeah, I've made up my mind. I'm going to ask her out."
    yt "好，我决定了。我要正式跟她开始约会。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1865
translate chinese klarapause_c6968587:

    # mc "Glenn, I would..."
    mc "格伦，我想……"

# game/ep4.rpy:1866
translate chinese klarapause_d7102a27:

    # gl "Hm?"
    gl "嗯？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1867
translate chinese klarapause_8ed7c85c:

    # mc "No, actually, I want to ask Gwen out. I want to officially date her. However, I believe it would be respectful to ask for your blessing beforehand."
    mc "我想和格温开始约会。我想正式跟她进入恋爱关系。我觉得现在必须请求您的同意和祝福。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1868
translate chinese klarapause_df268a82:

    # mc "So, Glenn, with your consent, may I be allowed to date your daughter, Gwen?"
    mc "所以格伦，请问我能从此和你的女儿格温成为恋人吗？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1869
translate chinese klarapause_59c4af92:

    # gl "Hrmnn? I thought you two were already dating?"
    gl "嗯嗯？？我以为你们已经在谈恋爱了？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1870
translate chinese klarapause_733babb2:

    # mc "Wait... Huh?"
    mc "等等……啊？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1873
translate chinese klarapause_54bef7dc:

    # g "Pfff... Wahahaha!"
    g "噗……哈哈哈哈哈哈！"

# game/ep4.rpy:1874
translate chinese klarapause_b313374a:

    # gl "Oh, you cheeky little girl! You got me again!"
    gl "噢，你个小丫头片子！你又骗住我了！"

# game/ep4.rpy:1875
translate chinese klarapause_695a65a5:

    # g "You really believed me on that?! Wahahaha!"
    g "我哪能想到你真的信了啊？！哈哈哈哈哈哈！"

# game/ep4.rpy:1876
translate chinese klarapause_604586ac:

    # gl "Gaaah!"
    gl "你啊！"

# game/ep4.rpy:1879
translate chinese klarapause_9a29bbcc:

    # yt "What a great relationship they have. I wonder what they're like when all three of them are together... That's a sight I definitely want to see..."
    yt "他俩的关系真好。不知道等他们一家三口团聚之后会是什么景象……我真的很想看看……"

# game/ep4.rpy:1882
translate chinese klarapause_f03e4736:

    # gl "Anywho... to answer your question. Of course, [mc!t]. You have my blessing."
    gl "总之……我现在回答你的问题。当然可以，[mc!t]。我祝福你们。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1883
translate chinese klarapause_f1779846:

    # g "*blushes*"
    g "*脸红*"

# game/ep4.rpy:1884
translate chinese klarapause_e191ee5a:

    # gl "However..."
    gl "但是呢……"

# game/ep4.rpy:1885
translate chinese klarapause_f4f23576:

    # gl "It's an entirely different story when it comes down to marriage."
    gl "要是结婚的话，就是另一码事了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1886
translate chinese klarapause_1c4c4654:

    # g "Aww, Dad~!"
    g "哎呀，爸~！"

# game/ep4.rpy:1887
translate chinese klarapause_d08e614e:

    # gl "If you want to go that far in the future, then you will have to prove to me that you're worthy of my daughter. I want you to show me that you can make her happy."
    gl "你要是想走到那一步，就得给我看看你到底配不配得上我女儿。我要看见你能让她每天都开心。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1888
translate chinese klarapause_fe76aae9:

    # gl "I assume you already know what to do, right?"
    gl "我想你已经知道该怎么办了吧？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1889
translate chinese klarapause_eef7c681:

    # mc "*nods* Mhm... You have my word on that, Glenn."
    mc "*点头* 嗯……我向你保证，格伦。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1890
translate chinese klarapause_3196f1be:

    # gl "Good."
    gl "很好。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1891
translate chinese klarapause_80076d19:

    # gl "I think I may have to leave now. It's almost time for my next appointment."
    gl "我现在应该得走了。马上到我下一场会的时间了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1894
translate chinese klarapause_fe45e33b:

    # gl "I'll entrust my daughter to you as I don't always have the time to meet up with her like this."
    gl "我没有时间经常跟我的女儿见面，所以我就把她交给你照顾了。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1895
translate chinese klarapause_16f8546e:

    # gl "Promise me that you'll take good care of her."
    gl "你得保证你会好好对她。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1896
translate chinese klarapause_0a4dbc8d:

    # mc "I promise."
    mc "我保证。"

# game/ep4.rpy:1897
translate chinese klarapause_abb01608:

    # gl "Haha! Excellent!"
    gl "哈哈！很好！"

# game/ep4.rpy:1898
translate chinese klarapause_eb5a47c3:

    # g "Goodbye, Dad. I'll see you next time?"
    g "再见，老爸。之后还能再见吧？"

# game/ep4.rpy:1899
